          "text": "Ankle swelling"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Mild stable evening ankle swelling, described as baseline. Examination showed no peripheral oedema and mild venous stasis changes at the ankles."
      }
    },
    {
